<span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2926b40d-b56a-4a55-a078-b5a24bb74095\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2926b40d-b56a-4a55-a078-b5a24bb74095\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;53&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-53</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Ettvard, I need you to get me into the Upper City. Those pricks at the gate won't let me through. Can't you leverage your influence? I need to take the temperature of the patriars, see what they think about this whole Absolute army thing. So be a dear and get me a pass or something - my arse is tired from sitting around the office.\n</p><p><br>\n- Estra Stir\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214857\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28877/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6999/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936836/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.869      1 Template:MiscItemP